# Mobile fullscreen popups

- Any popup/dialog that is a centered card on desktop must occupy the full viewport on mobile (`fixed inset-0`, `h-dvh`, no rounded card chrome).
- Use frosted glass styling by default (`bg-surface-elevated/70`, `backdrop-blur-2xl`, `backdrop-saturate-150`) via shared `DialogContent` / `PopoverContent`.
- Fullscreen mobile sheets always include a corner close (X) control, unless `preventDismiss` is set for required flows (e.g. onboarding).
- Implement this in shared `DialogContent` by default. Do not reintroduce per-dialog mobile sizing that breaks the sheet.
- Desktop-only width/max-height overrides belong on `md:` utilities (e.g. `md:w-[min(36rem,calc(100%-2rem))]`).
- Body content inside dialogs should scroll within the sheet (`min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto`), not expand the page.
- Custom overlays (e.g. watchlist filters) should follow the same mobile fullscreen rule when they act as popups.
